{
  "$comment": [
    "Praxis 三端 wire 契约的单一真源（2026-10-22 契约优先改造）。",
    "",
    "背景：同一份契约此前由三处手写镜像维护（schemas.py 107 字段 / protocol.rs 155 /",
    "agent.ts 180），靠 AGENTS.md 里一句「必须同步三处」的纪律维持。代价是可见的：",
    "一次字段改动波及 7-21 个文件，且仍会漏（GlossaryEntryDef 曾漏 rename_all 导致",
    "chapterTitle 不下发）。",
    "",
    "本文件只声明「跨端必须一致的核心字段」，不承担类型细节（各端仍按自身语言表达",
    "optional / default / 校验规则）：",
    "- fields：三端都必须存在的字段名（camelCase，即 wire 上的名字）；",
    "- required：其中必须在 wire 上出现的字段（其余可缺省）；",
    "- extra：允许存在的端特有字段（如数据库层的 status 只由 Rust/TS 携带，",
    "  Python 的图内模型没有这个概念）。",
    "",
    "校验入口：npm run check → scripts/protocol_check.py（TS + Python 双向比对）。",
    "Rust 侧不走脚本反射，由 protocol.rs 内的 wire 序列化测试保障（serde 的类型化",
    "比正则更可靠，重写为生成的收益不抵风险）。"
  ],
  "types": {
    "PlanRequest": {
      "required": ["goal"],
      "fields": [
        "goal",
        "level",
        "weeklyHours",
        "weeks",
        "interests",
        "background",
        "studyDays"
      ],
      "extra": []
    },
    "Chapter": {
      "required": ["title"],
      "fields": ["title", "summary", "contentMd", "kind", "keyTerms"],
      "extra": ["status"]
    },
    "StudyPhase": {
      "required": ["name"],
      "fields": [
        "name",
        "weekRange",
        "objectives",
        "chapters",
        "practice",
        "assignments",
        "project"
      ],
      "extra": ["status"]
    },
    "PhaseProject": {
      "required": [],
      "fields": [
        "name",
        "description",
        "background",
        "steps",
        "estimatedHours",
        "acceptanceCriteria"
      ],
      "extra": []
    },
    "StudyResource": {
      "required": ["title"],
      "fields": ["title", "type", "note", "url", "verification"],
      "extra": []
    },
    "GlossaryEntry": {
      "required": ["term"],
      "fields": ["term", "chapterTitle"],
      "extra": []
    },
    "StudyPlan": {
      "required": ["title"],
      "fields": [
        "title",
        "overview",
        "estimatedTotalHours",
        "phases",
        "resources",
        "reviewNotes",
        "glossary"
      ],
      "extra": []
    }
  }
}
